{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-exo-11-1","title":"Exodus 11:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 God's message to the Israelites to borrow jewels of their neighbours. 4 Moses threatens Pharaoh with the death of the firstborn.</p>\n<p>Yet will. 9:14; Le 26:21; De 4:34; 1Sa 6:4; Job 10:17; Re 16:9 afterwards. 3:20; Ge 15:14 thrust you. 12:31-39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-11-2","title":"Exodus 11:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>borrow. 3:22; 12:1,2,35,36; Ge 31:9; Job 27:16,17; Ps 24:1; 105:37 Pr 13:22; Hag 2:8; Mt 20:15 jewels. 32:2-4,24; 35:22; Eze 16:10-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-11-3","title":"Exodus 11:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>the Lord. 3:21; 12:36; Ge 39:21; Ps 106:46 Moses. Ge 12:2; 2Sa 7:9; Es 9:4; Isa 60:14; Ac 7:22; Re 3:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-11-4","title":"Exodus 11:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>About. 12:12,23,29; Job 34:20; Am 4:10; 5:17; Mt 25:6 will I go. 2Sa 5:24; Ps 60:10; Isa 42:13; Mic 2:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-11-5","title":"Exodus 11:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>the firstborn. 4:23; 12:12,29; 13:15; Ps 78:51; 105:36; 135:8; 136:10; Heb 11:28 behind. Jud 16:21; Isa 47:2; La 5:13; Mt 24:41</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-11-6","title":"Exodus 11:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>3:7; 12:30; Pr 21:13; Isa 15:4,5,8; Jer 31:15; La 3:8; Am 5:17 Zep 1:10; Lu 13:28; Re 6:16,17; 18:18,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-11-7","title":"Exodus 11:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>dog. Jos 10:21; Job 5:16 a difference. 7:22; 10:23; Mal 3:18; 1Co 4:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-11-8","title":"Exodus 11:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>And all. 12:31-33; Isa 49:23,26; Re 3:9 follow thee. Heb. is at they feet. Jud 4:10; 8:5; 1Ki 20:10; 2Ki 3:9; *marg: a great anger. Heb. heat of anger. Nu 12:3; De 29:24; 32:24; Ps 6:1; Eze 3:14; Da 3:19; Mr 3:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-11-9","title":"Exodus 11:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Pharaoh. 3:19; 7:4; 10:1; Ro 9:16-18 wonders. 7:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-11-10","title":"Exodus 11:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>the Lord. 4:21; 7:13,14; 10:20,27; De 2:30; 1Sa 6:6; Job 9:4; Ro 2:4,5; 9:22</p>"}]}